'''Pikachu Shocks Back issue 3''' is the seventh monthly issue of the manga series [[The Electric Tale of Pikachu]] to be released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains the seventh chapter of the manga, ''[[ET07|Pikachu's Excellent Adventure]]''. 

The contents of this issue were included as part of {{vol|Electric Tale of Pikachu|2}} along with [[ET05]], [[ET06]], and [[ET08]].

